    "Name": "Dragon DRX-OD",
    "Details": "Designed and produced in limited numbers by Luthien Armor Works, the DRX Dragon II Omni was an ambitious precursor to what would later become the DRG-11K. This particular configuration tests the limits of a 70-ton Mech's stability by fitting a Long Tom Cannon on the right arm. Like the other variants, the DRX-OD showcases a stunning variety of ammunition types, both for the artillery piece and the center-mounted Thunderbolt 10.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.07</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_dragonx"
  },
